  "chain": "un-hardened oil pump drive segment [cause B] -> accelerated wear of Train A compressor drive segment -> CRACS Train A retroactively determined incapable of 30-day mission (since June 29, 2024) [concurrent: EDG Train B planned maintenance outage -> CRACS Train B declared inoperable per TS 3.8.1 Required Action B.2] -> both CRACS trains concurrently inoperable, TS shutdown requirements not met (07/09 0330 - 07/18 1622) [no actual safety impact; offsite power remained available to CRACS Train B]",
